{"sections":[{"slug":"闭范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"闭范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">闭范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"闭范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">闭范畴是具有</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">态射对象</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">结构的范畴</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">两个对象</span> $X,Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">之间的态射的全体可视为范畴本身的一个对象</span> $[X,Y]$. <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">闭范畴是</span> “"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">于自身</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">常见的例子是闭幺半范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $[X,-]$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $X\\otimes -$ <span lang=\"zh\">的右</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">闭幺半范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">闭幺半范畴是满足如下条件的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(\\mathcal C,\\otimes)$: <span lang=\"zh\">对任意对象</span> $X\\in\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $X\\otimes -\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">有右</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":" $[X,-]\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/积闭范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">积闭范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}